@startuml
!include ../includes/attestify-theme.puml
!include ../includes/sequence-conventions.puml
title Verify Current Procedure
actor User
participant "Verify adapter" as Adapter
participant "VerifyProcedureUC" as UC
participant "Current-run store" as State
participant "NAPE Evaluator" as Evaluator
participant "Outcome commit" as Commit
User -> Adapter: nape verify
Adapter -> UC: empty request
UC -> State: reopen frozen run
State --> UC: closure + subject + evidence
loop each effective Action occurrence
  UC -> Evaluator: Test + evidence + evaluations + metadata
  Evaluator --> UC: conclusion + facts + reason
end
UC -> Commit: Report + relationship + raw evidence
Commit --> UC: atomic output observation
UC --> Adapter: Verify Receipt projection
@enduml
